 "body_html": "<h2>Como pensar</h2><p>O vértice da parábola é o ponto de <b>máximo</b> (se a < 0) ou de <b>mínimo</b> (se a > 0).</p><p><b>Ponto de máximo/mínimo</b>: xᵥ = −b ÷ 2a. <b>Valor máximo/mínimo</b>: yᵥ = f(xᵥ).</p><p>Em problemas, escreva a grandeza (área, lucro, altura) como uma função quadrática de x e calcule o vértice.</p><p>Com perímetro fixo, o retângulo de maior área é o quadrado.</p><div class='qfig'><svg data-pf='lg' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 330 250' width='330' height='250' role='img' aria-label='altura h(t) = −5t² + 20t'><g font-family='Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif'><line x1='34.0' y1='222.0' x2='34.0' y2='40.0' stroke='#d5dfec' stroke-width='1'/><line x1='99.5' y1='222.0' x2='99.5' y2='40.0' stroke='#d5dfec' stroke-width='1'/><text x='99.5' y='242.0' font-size='15' font-weight='600' fill='#2b2b2b' text-anchor='middle'>1</text><line x1='165.0' y1='222.0' x2='165.0' y2='40.0' stroke='#d5dfec' stroke-width='1'/><text x='165.0' y='242.0' font-size='15' font-weight='600' fill='#2b2b2b' text-anchor='middle'>2</text><line x1='230.5' y1='222.0' x2='230.5' y2='40.0' stroke='#d5dfec' stroke-width='1'/><text x='230.5' y='242.0' font-size='15' font-weight='600' fill='#2b2b2b' text-anchor='middle'>3</text><line x1='296.0' y1='222.0' x2='296.0' y2='40.0' stroke='#d5dfec' stroke-width='1'/><text x='296.0' y='242.0' font-size='15' font-weight='600' fill='#2b2b2b' text-anchor='middle'>4</text><line x1='34.0' y1='222.0' x2='296.0' y2='222.0' stroke='#d5dfec' stroke-width='1'/><line x1='34.0' y1='185.6' x2='296.0' y2='185.6' stroke='#d5dfec' stroke-width='1'/><text x='26.0' y='190.6' font-size='15' font-weight='600' fill='#2b2b2b' text-anchor='end'>5</text><line x1='34.0' y1='149.2' x2='296.0' y2='149.2' stroke='#d5dfec' stroke-width='1'/><text x='26.0' y='154.2' font-size='15' font-weight='600' fill='#2b2b2b' text-anchor='end'>10</text><line x1='34.0' y1='112.8' x2='296.0' y2='112.8' stroke='#d5dfec' stroke-width='1'/><text x='26.0' y='117